window.products.push({"id":394084,"name":"70th Birthday Decorations for The Best 70th Birthday Party - Includes Happy Birthday Banner, Large Number 70 Birthday Latex Balloons + 24 Balloons in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LfzFIfIgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A great 70th birthday celebration requires great party decorations. Get this party pack where everything is included and everything is very easy to set up. Click that \" Add to Cart \" button now! WHY SHOULD I BUY THIS? Well first off, it has been scientifically proven (or at least rumored) that this set of 70th birthday decor is creating the perfect setting for the big day.Here’s the deal...Turning 70 only happens once. So make sure to make the day memorable.By choosing this 70th birthday party pack you have everything you need in order to amaze everybody at the party. A LITTLE WARNING… These 70th birthday accessories will add the perfect setting for your party.You are going to receive a lot of positive comments about the decorations.And your party is sure to be remembered for a long time.Now your next question is perhaps… CAN THE BALLOONS BE FILLED WITH AIR OR HELIUM? All of our balloons can be filled with both air or helium. You choose. If you wish to fill the numbers and the balloon stars with air, simply insert the included straw (gently) into the plastic valve at the bottom of the letter and slowly blow to inflate. When the balloon is sufficiently inflated, pull out the straw and pinch the self-sealing plastic valve. The balloons will stay inflated for days. WHAT DOES IT TAKE TO SET UP THE DECORATIONS? Our decorations are very easy to set up however you want.You can set up the balloons in multiple ways:- Hanging from the ceiling in a attached string- Attached to a wall using some tape- Floating using helium and a string attached to the floor- Fill the small balloons with helium and let them float at the ceilingWe sincerely hope our 70th birthday set will make a fantastic addition to your amazing day.So go ahead...Click that \" Add to Cart \" button now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LfzFIfIgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Invitian","source_asin":"B075GPCDSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GPCDSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GPCDSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
