window.products.push({"id":394105,"name":"Discount For All Self Draining Soap Dishes, Dish, Drainer Dish Storage, Bar Holder, Case, Shower Dishes Bathroom + 1 Natural Loofah, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718HQAjvqlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why this soap dish? Easy-cleaning: Our soap saver comes with self draining technology, Which means that you do not have to often clean it. Anti-skid design / no soap slipping: It’s curvy design keeps the soap safe and doesn’t allow soap to slip or skid Compatible holder: This soap holder works great with every surface. Ideal size: This soap container has an ideal size of (4.33*3.14*0.9)in a soap holder for shower wall and bathroom soap holder Sleek Design: The minimalist design of the soap bar holder gives the perfect look for your bathroom & kitchen. Self draining: No more squashy and spongy soap! Multi-purpose: It can be a good helper for your kitchen sponges.It can be your travel soap dish or a soap holder for shower wall, basin, bathtub, and countertop, etc Material: Made with thick,durable, and fine-quality material, this soap holder has a long serving life. What’s Great About Natural Loofah? Pure and Natural Material: The body scrubber is made of 100% organic and natural material, which is perfect for you and your family. It can be easily cut into any size and shape you would like. Keeps Your Skin Clean and Moisturized: This loofah is a skincare tool - which helps reduce pimples, removes dead skin and leaves your skin smooth, wash away the oil on the skin surface, improve blood circulation, cleanse away everyday stress and worries ! Not Just For Bathing! Natural loofah has multiple uses. In addition to being used for bathing and exfoliating, loofah can also be used for household cleaning, washing dishes or barbecue grill. Package includes: One soap dish and one natural lookah. The perfect pair! Our Customer Service: If you are not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, NEWGEN is pleased to offer you a full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718HQAjvqlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Discount For All","source_asin":"B09DN83PK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DN83PK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DN83PK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
