window.products.push({"id":394163,"name":"Cozy Sherpa Angel Wrap, Poncho Blanket Jacket with Pockets, Hooded Cape Throw, Comfort Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614cTSugETL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"CAREFULLY CONSTRUCTED: Made with a solid design to ensure the most comfortable and practical wear. The large, Sherpa lined hood and front two buttons wrap the head and neck to keep warm no matter how cold the weather is. Cloak sleeve gives roomy, free movement space while keeping warm and is designed with pockets that can hold the phone, remote, snacks, or hands for extra warmth, making it convenient for all uses. PLUSH TO BERBER: Our hooded angel wrap blanket is made of a super cozy fleece fabric face and warm Sherpa lining. Slip it over your head like a poncho or wear it like a jacket, you can feel the warmth and softness around you like being wrapped up in a quilt. ONE SIZE FITS ALL, just pick your favorite color. MULTI FUNCTION USE: Fashionable look that is perfect for customers looking for coziness combined with style. This poncho blanket throw is great to use around the home. Wear it while watching TV, reading, and napping! It can also be used for outdoor camping, travel, daily wear, warm office jacket, or a nice Halloween costume for a cloak look. MAKES FOR A GREAT GIFT: This soft plush to Berber wearable blanket is cozy and practical. Combined with the elegant cape design, it is a perfect gift for a girlfriend, mom, sister, or a loved one for Valentine's Day, birthday, Christmas, Mother's Day or any special occasion. MACHINE WASHABLE: Simple and easy care. Hand wash or machine wash on gentle cycle with cold water in similar colors, then tumble dry on low heat. Do not iron. Recommended to wash it before the first use. High quality material and construction guarantees long-term use. After each wash, it will come out like new!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614cTSugETL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Degrees of Comfort","source_asin":"B099P6ZKV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099P6ZKV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099P6ZKV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394164,"name":"Warm and Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, 5.5L Top Fill Cool Mist Humidifier for Baby Nursery and Plants, 50H Work Time, Essential Oil Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611hK9Ool3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cool and Warm Mist humidifier】The warm and cool mist humidifiers for bedroom adopts advanced ultrasonic mist technology to increase the moisture content in the air.It has a unique negative ion purification system, which will greatly generate negative ions combined with air to improve air quality. In warm mist mode, the temperature of warm mist can reach 86-113℉, which can help you increase the indoor temperature. 【5.5L Large Capacity & 50Hrs Long-Lasting】With a 5.5L water tank, this warm mist humidifiers for bedroom covers a room of up to 323 sq.ft/ 30 m². It can run for up to 50 hours on the lowest mist level. Powerful mist output with high, mid and low settings makes this hot humidifier ideal for bedroom, kids room, baby nurseries, office, and indoor plants. 【Easy to Fill and Clean】Top fill design, opening the top cover of the filter free cool mist humidifier and add clean water directly into the water tank through the wide opening. The water tank of the easy clean humidifier is detachable as well, allowing you to clean it out under the tap. 【Auto off and Timer Setting】It features 3 levels of humidification (H/M/L) with an adjustable humidistat from 45% to 90%. The automatic shut-off feature turns the indoor humidifier for plants off when the room humidity exceeds set humidity, the water level is low or the tank is removed. 【Enjoy a Quiet Sleep】Running at as low as 35dB, the quiet air humidifier will stay in the background while you work or sleep at an almost silent frequency. The soothing night light provides a soft glow for maximum comfort, making it ideal for a bedroom or a baby room.You can also turn off the night light via the remote control or LCD dispaly. 【Essential Oil Diffuser Humidifier】 A built-in essential oil diffuser will spread juicy, calming, or relaxing scents to put you into the right mood.You can add aromatherapy through the aromatherapy box at the top or bottom of the humidifier. The ultrasonic air humidifier has 2 ways of control: remote control and LCD touch panel(when using the remote control, keep it facing the LCD screen).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611hK9Ool3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wowelife","source_asin":"B0BDKVQZ8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDKVQZ8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDKVQZ8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394165,"name":"TANMESSO Kids Alarm Clock Wake Up Light Easy to Set Toddler, Children, Teens, Boys and Girls, LED Digital Alarm Clock with Snooze, Temperature Detect ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Jvzsr88L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"GREAT SLEEP TRAINING FOR KIDS - There's nothing worse than being woken up in the middle of the night by kids who think it's already morning (especially when it's the first week back at school), or having to pull your kids out of bed with the jaws of life in the morning. But what's the key to getting the kids up and to the bus stop on time? TANMESSO digital alarm clock. ELEGANT ALARM CLOCK WITH LED DISPLAY - Our cute alarm clock with large clear LED display makes it easy to check the time from the other side of the room. It has multiple built-in functions, 12 and 24 hour modes, date, temperature (°C/F°), night light mode, alarm settings and snooze function for your desk, bedside, bedroom, home and office etc. CHILDREN’S BEDROOM NIGHT LIGHT - This small battery alarm clock emits 7 colors of light. Support automatic light switching between yellow, red, purple, blue, indigo, green and cyan. Light is warm and natural, creating a romantic night for your child. Let our bedroom clock night light accompany your child to get rid of the darkness. PERFECT GIFT FOR KIDS & BEDSIDE ALARM CLOCK - TANMESSO LED digital alarm clock is cute in color and easy to use, making it the perfect gift for kids and families for Christmas, birthdays, holidays, etc. This wake up light alarm clock not only teaches your kids when to go to bed and when to get up, but also helps them get more sleep while teaching them to be independent and grow with their family. AFTER SALES SERVICE - We always maintain a service attitude of 100% customer satisfaction. If you have any questions about our alarm clock, please feel free to contact us. We will reply to your questions ASAP and give you a satisfactory shopping experience. Look no further and ORDER your TANMESSO alram clock today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Jvzsr88L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANMESSO","source_asin":"B0B1GMJB6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1GMJB6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1GMJB6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
