window.products.push({"id":394177,"name":"Norpro Cast Iron Pig Shaped Bacon Press with Wood Handle, 8.5in/21.5cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91utqWrn-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description \" Measures: 8.25\" x 5\" x 3 / 21cm x 13cm x 7.5cm Even the best cut bacon can curl, making it difficult to cook evenly. Our Pig-Shaped Cast Iron Grill Press flattens the bacon, keeping its shape for even cooking. Features a wooden handle that stays cool to the touch. Ideal for bacon, ham, grilled sandwiches, hamburgers and quesadillas. Or use as a steak weight! In a skillet on the stovetop or outside on the grill! Includes instructions for seasoning before use, cleaning and storage. Hand wash, rinse thoroughly and dry with a paper towel - never soak cast iron. Before Use: Wash in warm, soapy water. Rinse and dry thoroughly. Put a small amount of vegetable oil in fry pan. Lightly coat Bacon Press with vegetable oil. Place face down in fry pan. Heat over very low heat for 20 minutes. Wipe off excess oil with paper towel. Your Bacon Press is now seasoned and ready for use. (Caution: Do not use in a nonstick fry pan as it may scratch the finish.) Cleaning & Storage: After each use, wash and dry thoroughly and lightly re-coat with vegetable oil before storing. If there are signs of rust then re-season by following the steps above. Norpro was founded in 1973 with a vision to design, manufacture, and supply the highest caliber kitchenware. Norpro's offering of innovative, high quality product for cooking, preparing and serving food are produced with superior materials and craftsmanship. Those who like their bacon flat rather than curled, especially for making BLTs, will enjoy using this pig-shaped bacon press from Norpro. Made of heavy cast iron with a wooden knob-style handle, the press lays right on top of bacon during frying, and also works well on quesadillas, grilled cheese sandwiches or thickly filled panini, and pork chops that have a tendency to curl at the edges. Care should be taken when used on food in a nonstick skillet not to scratch the finish. Whimsical as well as handy, the bacon press measures 8-1/2 inches in length and can be easily washed by hand. Ann Bieri \" Amazon.com Those who like their bacon flat rather than curled, especially for making BLTs, will enjoy using this pig-shaped bacon press from Norpro. Made of heavy cast iron with a wooden knob-style handle, the press lays right on top of bacon during frying, and also works well on quesadillas, grilled cheese sandwiches or thickly filled panini, and pork chops that have a tendency to curl at the edges. Care should be taken when used on food in a nonstick skillet not to scratch the finish. Whimsical as well as handy, the bacon press measures 8-1/2 inches in length and can be easily washed by hand. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91utqWrn-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norpro","source_asin":"B0002IBQWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002IBQWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002IBQWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
