window.products.push({"id":394243,"name":"ARTZONE Tiffany Fireplace Screen Stained Glass Screens Gas and Wood Burning Fire Spark Guard Grate 44 Inch Wide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Eha2PIx6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Is there anything cozier than cranking up your fireplace on a cold winter’s day (or even a cool summer evening)? Whether wood-burning or gas, it’s always a good idea to contain the flames with a fireplace screen. It doesn’t take much to transform the look of a fireplace, and this simple screen, which also comes in pewter, should do just the trick. Frame material: Stained Glass Dimensions: overall width 43.6”, center panel 22”, height 27.8” Though the style of this screen might looks a little less contemporary and a little more old-world, its fish-scale motif would fit in just as beautifully into a traditional space as it would a modern living room. Fireplace doors cover the opening of the firebox when a fire is not burning and can help eliminate drafts and cold air coming down the chimney into your home. The Hearth, Patio, and Barbeque Association recommends that all fireplaces be provided with glass doors especially if you burn real wood. Artzone fireplace screen are helpful in reducing air leakage up the chimney, eliminating hearth odors when the fireplace is not in use, and stopping smoke spillage into your room. Artzone fireplace screen are not only functional keeping the cold air out of your home and the warmth in, they add a finished, decorative touch to your fireplace. After burning a fire, the firebox may have unsightly stained walls, piles of ashes, or soot stained gas logs. Our artzone stained glass covers the firebox and makes it easy to hide the remnants of a fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Eha2PIx6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTZONE","source_asin":"B088H8YR89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088H8YR89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088H8YR89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
