window.products.push({"id":394289,"name":"BeeBAGZ - Beeswax Wrap Storage Bag, Reusable Food Storage Bags, Pack of 6, Plastic Free Biodegradable Food Wrap Alternative, Family Pack, 3 Small + 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dDe3r-YTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% cotton 100% Natural Ingredients: BeeBAGZ are 100% natural, composed of organic cotton, a double stitched seam and beeswax. Ditch the single use plastic and use our all-natural beeswax wrap storage bags which are designed to be used over and over again. Why Bags are Better: A perfect alternative to wraps, these beeswax food bags help to keep your food tightly sealed without having to apply multiple fancy folds while maintaining food’s freshness. These beeswax wrap food bags provide an attractive storage solution that helps to reduce food wastage and household spend. Whether used as a food wrap at home or packed for travel and adventures. Keep Food Fresh: These beeswax wrap food storage bags are naturally breathable and proven to keep your fruit, bread, vegetable, cheese and other snack foods fresher, longer than plastic wraps and bags, while maintaining their taste. Pack includes 3 Small (6.5” x 4.5”), 2 Medium (8.5” x 6.5”), and 1 Large (11\" x 14\") beeswax reusable food bags which can be for food storage at home or on the go. Easy to Use & Breeze to Clean: BeeBAGZ has a self sealing, water resistant closure. Simply place your food in the bag, fold over the top and create a seal with the warmth of your fingers. Use a mild dish soap to wash and leave to dry, no harsh chemicals or hot water required. Be Eco-friendly & Go Green: All of our BeeBAGZ products are sustainably produced and environmentally friendly food storage solutions. With our all-natural products, we are giving people a choice to help support mother nature. We believe in green growth & green development for a green future. Start your plastic free diet now with BeeBAGZ and feel good about the choice you make for your family and the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dDe3r-YTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeBAGZ","source_asin":"B07NWZGL7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NWZGL7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NWZGL7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394290,"name":"Sponge Holder + Brush Holder, Adhesive 2-in-1 Kitchen Sink Caddy, SUS304 Stainless Steel, Rustproof, No Drilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+D2UgnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must have for your sink - 2-IN-1 stainless steel sponge brush holder! Very very special , there is two lines which make you adjust your rack height between the sink bottom as you like. Organize your sink accessories and cleaning utensils for easy access. Don’t misplace your kitchen sponge or OXO dish brush; Open wire design encourages the cleaning supplies to dry fully, minimizing bacteria growth. * It big enough to have room for a second item if you store sponge vertically. * It has one end open, suit for longer sponge, no need fold and take it easier. * The rack rests on the adhered tabs then it allows you to easily take it off if necessary when you're cleaning the sink. What You Get: 1 x Sponge Holder, 2 x Adhesive, 1 x User Manual(Sponge and Brush not included in package) please note: If the rack keeps falling off the bracket, the problem is you do not realize that you have to force the holder into the bracket that you stick onto the sink, once you get it in, it is not coming off for any reason. Do not only lay the holder on top of the hooks on the bracket. Where to use: ONLY stick on smooth hard surfaces. DON'T stick on painted walls or wallpapers as it will take off your paint or wallpapers. How to use: 1. Clean the area where the adhesive installed and dry. 2. Peel off the protective cover on the back, install the adhesive and press firmly to squeeze air out. 3. Wait 30 mins for the adhesive to set. 4. Hang the shelf on the hook. It can be used 3 years after installation. You have to push it in pretty hard for it to snap into place! How to remove: 1.You can use a hair dryer to heat the adhesive surface, then tear off the installed adhesive. Do not worry about the adhesive leaving any residue on the sink surface. 2.Just pull the rack out of the hook for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+D2UgnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"\"N/A\"","source_asin":"B08FHR2FYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHR2FYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHR2FYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
