window.products.push({"id":394349,"name":"Elegant Comfort Ultra-Soft Double Brushed 6-Piece Microfiber Sheet Set. Beautiful Tropical Patterns, and Vibrant Solid Colors, Luxury, All-Season Bed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CtkQ12J9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a Experience of a true luxury and a cool comfortable night's sleep with exceptionally breathable bed sheets that have a silky soft feel and a lustrous finish. Soft to the touch, easy care No ironing necessary. Microfiber is a unique type of material. It is composed of very finely woven fibers. Microfiber sheets are strong and exceptionally smooth and comfortable. High quality microfiber increases the strength and durability of these linens. Microfiber holds color very well; it will not fade or dull after years of use, even if washed often or exposed to sunlight. Microfiber also wicks away moisture or humidity so they can easily be used during winter months as well as during the summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CtkQ12J9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Comfort","source_asin":"B08B43RBPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B43RBPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B43RBPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394350,"name":"Black Beeswax Pillar Candle - 6\" Hand-Rolled Pure Bees Wax Candles - Handmade Unscented Candles With Cotton Wick - for Relaxation, Meditation and Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YqMcV7n+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPLIFT ANY INTERIOR Our Horizon beeswax pillar candles are the perfect way to instantly transform any space for a special occasion. Releasing an enchanting subtle aroma with a light honey fragrance, we use these candles for prayer, rituals, natural lighting, at birthdays, and for dinner parties. THE GIFT OF HARMONY Sustainably sourced with ethical production principles by beekeepers in Western Ukraine, our black organic beeswax is then hand rolled locally by our master wax artisans. Delivered in recyclable materials, these organic beeswax candles are produced + packaged with a minimal carbon footprint, making them a gift for us + the planet. 100% ORGANIC BEESWAX We use nothing but premium pure beeswax and a cotton wick when creating our candles. We roll each candle by hand and honor the centuries-old tradition of candle craftsmanship by keeping our candles free from chemicals, scents, or questionable additives. ALL-NATURAL CANDLE Measuring 6-inches tall and 2.75-inches in diameter, each Horizon black natural beeswax candle is designed to fit our pillar candle holder. They each maintain a 4 hour burn time. While the honeycomb pattern of our candles leaves more room for oxygen, allowing them to burn faster than solid candles, beeswax naturally burns longer than paraffin, soy, or any other candle wax blends. If you need some info on lighting and maintaining your candle properly, just take a look at our how-to video that is located with our product images.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YqMcV7n+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UkrEcoGoods","source_asin":"B07VC46RQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VC46RQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VC46RQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
