window.products.push({"id":394372,"name":"Angelo:HOME Elton Collection Round End Table, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZkmWp6V+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The mid-century style Elton collection end table in a warm walnut finish includes a useful and exquisite highlight to any living space. This end table highlights delightful veneer table top and strong wood legs with metal completed brackets. Outlined by Angelo Surmelis, this end table match with Elton collection Coffee Table (which is sold separately). Made of MDF, wood and metal brackets. End table dimension 20\" W x 20\" D x 24\" H. Some assembly required. When he was six, Angelo Surmelis and his family moved from Greece to the United States. In their new home, six-year-old Angelo started dragging furniture around, rearranging it. From that early age, he believed that your space - and the way it's arranged - can change the way you feel. This philosophy has landed him on design series on TLC, Lifetime, The Style Network, and HGTV, as well as several different television talk shows. Now, with Angelo's line of furniture and accessories, you can change your space - and the way you feel - quickly and affordably.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZkmWp6V+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"angelo:HOME","source_asin":"B078JCGQ7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JCGQ7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JCGQ7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
