window.products.push({"id":394411,"name":"Hosley Japanese Cherry Blossoms Highly Scented Fragrance Warming Oils, Box of 5, 55 ml 1.86oz ea. Ideal Gift for Weddings, spa, Reiki, Meditation, Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DdryWneEL._AC_SL1026_.jpg","description":"Made in the USA! Hosley Set of 5, 55 ml Japanese Cherry Blossoms Fragrance Warming Oils. Create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere in your home with Hosley warming oils. As the fragrance is dispersed throughout your home it will freshen the air and help assist in removing lingering odors. Use these oils with any electric or candle dispenser (sold separately) to disperse its welcoming fragrance throughout your home. These oils do not produce any wick or soot making an easy clean-up with just a paper towel. With only a few drops, these oils will release a captivating aroma in the air. These fragrance warming oils are environmentally friendly and are highly concentrated. It is even suitable for refreshing dried out potpourri, making it fragrant once again. Try combining two or more scents to create your own enchanting fragrance. Wrap them up as a gift or use them as a stocking stuffer. Spread these fragrances around and share with your family and friends. Instructions: For use with oil warmers only. Use oil as is. Do not dilute. Follow the directions of the oil warmer for amount to be used (DO NOT OVERFILL). Only add oil to a clean warmer that is at room temperature. Caution: Skin and eye irritant. Do not ingest. Keep out of reach of children and pets. May damage finished surfaces if spill occurs. Contains fragrance oils. (Product label may differ).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DdryWneEL._AC_SL1026_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosley","source_asin":"B09FLM43XF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLM43XF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLM43XF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394412,"name":"DELLING Set of 2 Tart Pans, 9.5 inch Quiche Pan, Ceramic Fluted Quiche Baking Dish/Pie Pan, Perfect for Baking Tart Pies and Chicken Pot Pie, Cheeseca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vgJUvSJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE QUICHE BAKING PAN - Round quiche pan with 9.5\" in outer edge diameter and 1.4\" deep is great for baking such as pie, pizza, fruit tart, crustless quiche, chicken pot, cheesecake, creme brulee, and more. FLUTED RIM DESIGN - Ceramic tart pans are rounded with fluted edges for added friction and less slipping out of your hands. Quiche dishes also hold heat well, are well insulated, keep warm, and the pie bakes evenly. HIGH QUALITY - Sturdy ceramic pie pan made of white glazed porcelain, safe and odor-free, not chipping and cracking, withstands high temperatures so you don't over or under bake. The freezer, microwave, oven, and dishwasher are safe. EASY TO CLEAN & DURABLE - Ceramic pie dishes are glazed coated, which makes them easy to wash or dishwasher clean and won't scratch easily. This pie plate works well as a serving dish and is less likely to scratch and leave marks easily. GREAT GIFT - The quiche dish is a classic white and fun shape, easy to bake into beautiful pies, creating strikingly delicious dishes that help you achieve masterful cuisine. Ideal for holidays such as Halloween, and Christmas Day, for everyday use, or as a gift for friends or family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vgJUvSJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DELLING","source_asin":"B08YJ8YZMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJ8YZMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJ8YZMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
