window.products.push({"id":394448,"name":"Paddie Bar Stools Set of 4, Bar Chairs with Back Armrest Retro Modern Swivel Adjustable for Kitchen Counter Dining Room, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j3GdvKDnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅[HIGH SITTING COMFORT] Made of Elegant & Wear-resistant PU leather padded with high-density foam seat and back, providing the ultimate comfort. The stools are ergonomically designed. You can lean against the back of the stool and put your legs on the footrest for a better sitting position and long conversations. ✅[STURDY & DURABLE] Built with heavy-duty 16.1\" steel chrome. Bottom non-slip rubber ring can protect the floor from scratching and a harsh sound when moving the bar chairs. Solid stool sturdy enough to hold up to 331 lbs. The PU leather and chrome base make cleaning a breeze, so your chair will always look and feel brand new. ✅[ADJUSTABLE & SWIVEL] By raising the lever under the seat to adjust the heights easily. The lifting mechanisms works perfectly, you can adjust it to different heights and keep stable. The seat height ranges from 24.2\" to 32.7\". The bar stools can be 360° rotated, so you can fetch things or chat with others without moving. ✅[EASY TO INSTALL] The set of 4 bar chairs features a simple style and easy installation design. All accessories come included with the set, and shipped in high-strength packaging to protect them from shipping damage. Quick installation method saves valuable time, you just need to assemble the bar stool set according to the installation manual. ✅[CUSTOMER SERVICE GUARANTEE] Paddie insists on excellent quality to make your sitting safe and enjoyable. We will solve your problem for your preference for any defective workmanship or parts missing problem. Our bar stools set of 4 are suitable for kitchen, dining room, coffee room, resting room, entertainment centers and office, bring you more convenience and comfortable experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j3GdvKDnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddie","source_asin":"B08Q84MG2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q84MG2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q84MG2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394449,"name":"Light of Mine | Fiberglass Replacement Tiki Torch Wick | 0.5\" Length 9.85\" | Long Lasting | Perfect for Outdoor Tiki Torch |Wine Bottles | Lanterns | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711tQJAlWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why are fiberglass wicks better then cotton wicks? Unlike replacement cotton wicks, our fiberglass wicks will last indefinitely with normal use, saving you money and time in the long run. Our replacement wicks require only about 1/4\" to 1/2\" exposure from the torch or lamp. For best results, the fiberglass wick should be exposed just enough to provide a smooth and steady flame shape. If your wick is overexposed, the flame will be unsteady, ragged, smoke excessively and waste fuel. It's best to start with a 1/4\" inch exposed wick, and work your way up from there until you achieve your desired flame. Fiberglass wicks are not consumed during use, however, they may need to be replaced if contaminated with water or poor-quality fuel. You will find wick replacement necessary when switching between paraffin oil, torch fuel or kerosene, and remember to let a new wick absorb the oil in the lamp before you light it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711tQJAlWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIGHT OF MINE \"LET IT SHINE\"","source_asin":"B0B643P34Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B643P34Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B643P34Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
