window.products.push({"id":394487,"name":"Pizza Turning Peel - 9\" Round Aluminum Metal Pizza Spinner w/TWO Long Handle (48 & 24 in) - Pizza Peel Perforated for Backyard pizza oven-Pizza Peel T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FRvwQK7OS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"[ Premium Turning Pizza peel ] - You can spin your pizzas like a pro with our premium turning peel! This round pizza peel is made from durable aluminum & metal perforated pizza peel, so dough does not stick. Pizza spatual paddle perfect for baking. It is great for outdoor wood fire or brick ovens. The pizza turning peel features a round blade and 2 detachable handles (24\" & 48\" long). Interchangeable pizza paddle lengths. [ Built From Quality ] - Our round pizza peel for turning is built from industrial grade aluminum that can withstand extremely high temperatures and a strong detachable non wooden handle. Metal that does not get hot. This Round turning peel features a tapered edge that makes it easier to slide under dough. A little flour or cornmeal will help a quick transfer to pizza steel or pizza plate. Ideal for outdoor pizza oven to turn pizza easily. [ Prevent Burns ]- Our metal turning pizza peel allows you to turn dough with precision. You will be a pizza spinner pro. . With such precision, this perforated pizza peel allows you to use less cornmeal and also makes the bottom of the pizza more crispy. aluminum pizza peel helps with high temperatures. [Versatile Options ] - This aluminum turning peel pack includes two extra detachable handles (24\" & 48\" long) that keep your hands further away from the hot oven surface. It is a handy pizza spatula, flip that pizza like a pro. The beauty of the detachable handles is it's easy to clean and store. Easy to swap out. Three screws to replace. A small screwdriver comes with the professional pizza turner. Use for commercial pizza oven or outdoor pizza oven, it is a perfect pizza oven accessories. [ Easy to Use- Great Gift for Pizza Lovers ] - Get our metal perforated pizza peel today the pizza turner is perfect for beginner or expert. We are a family run business in the US. We fell in love with making pizza's in our back yard. We cook for the whole neighborhood and want you to do the same. Add to your pizza topping station, round turning pizza peel, pizza spatual paddle, super peel, pizza oven spatula, all things that will add to your party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FRvwQK7OS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juggle Life","source_asin":"B08YJPMWB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJPMWB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJPMWB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
