window.products.push({"id":394557,"name":"CuddlePlushy Towel Sets for Bathroom, Pakistan Cotton Bath Towels Set - 6 Pack, 2 Bath Towels 30x58, 2 Hand Towels 18x28, 2 Wash Cloths 13x13, Absorbe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71En4rmNqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅TOP LEVEL Pakistan COTTON TOWEL: Start your amazing day after taking a shower with the towels or show your overnight guests your good taste! 100% long-staple Pakistan cotton is chosen to produce luxurious quality, bath shower towels. Woven with responsibly sourced pure Pakistan cotton(12 Hours full sunshine), you have nothing but the finest and softest of bath towels. 525GSM natural cotton ensures the thickness, softness, as well as lightweight. ✅6 VALUE PACK, FLUFFIER AFTER WASH: 6-Pack premium quality 525GSM Pakistan long-staple cotton towel sets for bathroom contains 2 big bath towels (30'' x 58''), 2 hand towels (18'' x 28'') and 2 washcloths (13'' x 13''). You need nothing else - our bath towels set includes all the necessary towels for bathroom. The double stitched hem and diamond weave ensures durability, strength, tear resistance. ✅HIGHLY ABSORBENT & QUICK DRYING & PLUSH: Constructed with a low twist terry loop, our bath towels in plush 525GSM give them exceptional absorbency and softness and making a bath towel of this generous gram weight and dry fast. High efficiency in drying you off in seconds, saving you extra minutes in a rushing morning and no worry about a damp hand towel after washing up. Its softness is gonna to save your skin after a horrible sun burnt ✅OEKO-TEX, FREE CHEMICAL, STAPLE DYE LOT: Our bath towels are OEKO-TEX Certified, verifying the bathroom towel sets free of harmful substances that have safe and socially responsible work practices. Buy the bathroom towel set with confidence even you are allergy suffers with sensitive skin. Discoloration test done-fade resistant. A decent gift choice for Thanksgiving Day, Christmas and New Year! ✅COMPLETE BATHROOM DECORATION - Unlike traditional heavy cotton towels, the lightweight, soft and luxury bath towels give you a spa like luxurious experience at home after every shower. White color for clean fresh hotel bathroom look fans - other vibrant colors to complete your bathroom decoration! Treat yourself with the sustainable product without compromising on comfort and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71En4rmNqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CuddlePlushy","source_asin":"B08SJ6LDQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJ6LDQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJ6LDQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
