window.products.push({"id":394647,"name":"MAXIJIN Stretch Velvet Wingback Chair Slipcover 1-Piece Soft Stylish Plush Slipcovers for Wingback Chairs Thick Rich Velvet Wing Chair Cover with Elas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612SDDXexhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RICH VELVET: MAXIJIN stretch wingback chair cover is made of luxurious and thick velvet fabric, exquisite craftsmanship with dense and smooth short pile which is breathable, anti-wrinkle, no pilling or fading after washing, extra delicate texture for soft and sturdy touch that will not irritating to your skin. Using our wing chair slipcover will make your wing chair brand new which can also create a charming household elements for your home in an easy way, much better than reupholstering STAY IN PLACE: Our anti-slip wingback chair slipcover use elastic velvet fabric, which can fully stretch and cover your wing chair in whole easily. The 4 straps sewn at the bottom that fasten around the legs would firmly keep the wing chair cover in place without sliding. Besides, due to the unique sewing technology of our stretch wing chair slipcover, it's very easy to install and disassemble, more convenient for you to wash the wingback chair slipcover regularly FULL PROTECTION: Our durable slipcovers for wingback chairs adopt full coverage design so that it can protect your wingback chair in all directions. Due to our thick smooth fabric of the rich velvet, our wingback chair slipcover is thick enough to prevent daily wear and accidental stains, pet hair, scratches, bites and paw print. You don't have to worry about wing chair getting frayed or dirty when your kids and pets play on the chair. Great choice for cloth and leather wingback chair UPGRADED FIT: MAXIJIN fitted wing chair cover is super stretchy so it conforms to most chair shapes, such as wingback chair, accent chair, antique chair and queen anne chair. Our elastic wing chair cover fits wing chair with length 30\"-35\", width 28\"-33\", height 42\"-45\", which can fit your chair perfectly, just like it is made for your wing chair. Please refer to the size measurement guide in the photo, confirm the size of your wing chair before ordering EASY CARE: This magical velour wing chair slipcover is machine washable which can maintain its shape well after repeated washing. Please wash at or below 30 degrees Celsius. Do not bleach, do not iron. Use mild detergent, gentle cycle, tumble dry low in order to keep the bright color. If you have any concern about our wing chair slipcovers, we will be pleased to assist you in the first time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612SDDXexhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXIJIN","source_asin":"B08XQPGT8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQPGT8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQPGT8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":394648,"name":"Creative Scents Vintage White Bathroom Toothbrush Holder, Family Brush Toothpaste Cup- Holds Multiple Standard/Electric Toothbrushes (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pr3nhG8AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"TRANSFORM YOUR BATHROOM INTO AN ELEGANTLY EXQUISITE OASIS Classic Touch The Vintage White collection pays homage to timeless shape and design. It features clean lines and symmetrical curves to create the perfect clash between simplicity and elegance. The whitesilver Vintage White pattern continues the theme of exquisite symmetry across every piece, blending beautifully with the touch of milk white. If you’re a lover of classic design, then the Vintage White collection is the perfect fit. And we’ve carefully-crafted every item to ensure it fits in your space. Whether you have a gigantic bathroom or one with limited space to spare, this is the perfect bath set collection for a mix of eye-catching design and superior functionality. Designed to Last Not all bath sets are created equal. Some rust in no time. Some break a couple of days in. And others are completely different from what is pictured. Creative Scent’s Vintage White collection however, is specially-designed to handle bath conditions, ensuring durability that is simply unmatched. Every piece is made using the highest-quality resin, with the elegant pattern finished in non-chipping paint. So you end up with bathroom accessories that will keep drawing in those compliments for years to come! Here’s why you’ll love the Vintage White collection: - Classic shapes and lines to suit just about any taste. - Vintage White pattern creates beautiful symmetry. - Made using high-grade resin to ensure maximum durability. - Perfectly-sized to fit even tight-spaced bathrooms. - Unique design makes it a great gift for both men and women. Count on the Vintage White bath set collection to spruce up your bathroom and impress you with incredible quality that will last you for years. Click ‘Add to Cart’ now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pr3nhG8AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Scents","source_asin":"B071X7M22R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071X7M22R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071X7M22R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
