window.products.push({"id":394712,"name":"Btanadi Thermal Switch Thermal Fan Switch for Fireplace Blower (115 Degree ON, 90 Degree OFF) (2 PCS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sUHRaxVyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Is your fireplace fan running all the time regardless of how hot fireplace is? This thing is a very simple mechanical switch. When it is exposed to heat a small piece of metal inside this thing bends and makes contact and the fan runs. Do they wear out? Yep !! After a year or two either the fan won’t come on or runs all the time. Using this on a freestanding gas stove that looks like a wood stove. But all wood stoves, gas stoves etc with a fan have these.   FEATURES:  This thermal activated switch comes on when temperature is reached and stays on till the stove drops it the lower temperature.   115°F AT \"ON\" - The Thermal Switch will turn your fireplace blower \"on\" when the temperature reaches 115°F.   \"OFF\" AT 90°F - The Thermal Switch will turn your blower \"off\" when the temperature reaches 90°F.   PACKGE INCLUDES:  3 X 115-120V 15A Thermal Switch   Blower for almost all single and double fireplaces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sUHRaxVyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Btanadi","source_asin":"B0BC7P7HWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC7P7HWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC7P7HWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
