window.products.push({"id":394720,"name":"Anti Fatigue Mats for Kitchen Floor/Kitchen Accessories Floor Mats/Standing Mat for Standing Desk Home Office/Foot Pain Relief Non Slip Mat/Ergonomic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PIpD5alYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👩‍⚕️MEDICAL: Anti-fatigue mats are proven to improve blood circulation throughout the body, reduce back pain and stress caused when standing for long periods of time, prevent injury and stress to ankle, knee, hip joints, as well as the feet. Overall, quality antifatigue mats like KC&N products help to increase overall production and comfort while performing work or your daily routine that require standing, kneeling or lying on hard surfaces. 👷SAFETY: KC&N anti fatigue mats are built to be durable to withstand regular walking traffic and supportive for long standing working environments. The beveled edge design adds safety and helps with transitioning an individuals' feet from floor to mat, reducing the likelihood of accidental trips over mat edges that do not have beveled edges. 👨‍🚒SPILL PROOF: KC&N understands that accidents and spills may occur and have designed our anti-fatigue mats to be waterproof and shock absorbent. The outer material will not allow wet spills to absorb and destroy the quality of the mat. The shock absorbent design acts as a memory foam that cushions and bounces back which prevent ceramic cups or glassware from shattering when dropped on the mat itself. A quick wipe with a damp cloth for wet spills and a small broom and dustpan for dry spills. 👩‍🍳USAGE: KC&N products aim in bringing quality, safety, comfort, and inspiration to our consumers through our products. The artistic designs embossed on our anti fatigue mats were chosen to inspire, appeal to your health, and promote a spiritual well-being in mind and body. Our Anti-fatigue mats can be used in creative places such as music recording studios, art studios, salons, home entertainment, private bars, dens, prayer areas, and the lists goes on. 👨‍🔬DURABILITY: KC&N anti-fatigue mats are built to be durable, safe, comfortable. Its exterior composition helps against abrasion and fading of its outer design as long as proper care is utilized. Its 0.47” foam interior design allows the mat to bounce back to its natural form even after minutes of applied body weight and compression. Also, its outer shell prevents most liquids from soaking into the mat thus protecting the mat from distortion and preventing bacteria from being trapped within.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PIpD5alYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KC&N","source_asin":"B0BBNHGMNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBNHGMNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBNHGMNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
