window.products.push({"id":394818,"name":"TAOCOCO 100% Waterproof Recliner Couch Covers with Console, Sofa Covers for Reclining Sofa 3 Seat with Straps Design, Split Recliner Sofa Cover Furnit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OZSQXBarL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% WATERPROOF FABRIC】We use high-grade fabric to undergo waterproof treatment by coating a waterproof layer on the top, to ensure our recliner couch cover provides 100% guaranteed waterproof and leak-proof features. This new waterproof feature (can be tested), is a great way to protect your sofa from any drinks, spills, daily wear and tear. Making sure your furniture are clean at all times. 【HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL】TAOCOCO reclining loveseat covers are made of choiceness material, quilted from 5 layers of durable fabric, and the inner-layer is filled with cotton texture fabric to make it more comfortable, soft, durable and strong, it would be a great choice for homes with kids and pets.(Service Guarantee: If have any questions on the product, please contact us for help.） 【DIMENSIONS GUIDE】 3 seater recliner cover fit the sofa with a seat width of 23.6 in, see measurement guide in photos. Thanks to the separated design of our recliner sofa cover, it can be fitted into more styles of recliner sofa(with center console and cup holder). Please measure the size of your sofa before purchasing. 【REDUCE SLIP-OFF CONCEPT】Reduce the sliding! 1. Solid round colloid design on the back of our recliner cover; 2. Additional flexible elastic straps; 3.Two elastic bands at seat's back side and the matching buckle, secure the black bands that through the groove between the back and arm with the buckle, reduce the slide of the recliner cover, even on the leather furnitures. (Tips: We have extra straps for sale, if the original straps are broken or missing, please contact us for a replacement). 【Easy to install & Easy care】Check the installation guide carefully, our recliner slipcovers are very easy to install (Please pay attention to the accuracy and cutting of the cup holder slipcover). Care instruction: Hand or machine washable, wash at a temperature around 30 degrees Celsius, mild laundry detergent advice. Do not bleach. Do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OZSQXBarL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAOCOCO","source_asin":"B09JRT4YQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JRT4YQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JRT4YQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
