window.products.push({"id":394838,"name":"Qoosea Christmas Tree Topper Lighted Christmas Star Topper with LED Rotating Snowflake Projector Lights 2-in-1 Gold Star Tree Topper for Christmas Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816Vv3TFnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC DESIGN: The Christmas tree topper features a classic openwork star design, built-in LED projection lights, and a classic golden color scheme to make your Christmas tree more attractive and bring a more festive atmosphere to your party. This star treetop is designed with warm white light to bring you a warm and comfortable atmosphere. You and your family will be very relaxed and enjoy the night. GLITTERED CHRISTMAS LED STAR LIGHT: A rotating projection light is built in the middle of the star-shaped housing, it can not only cast a warm white snow image on the ceiling, but also on the wall. The farther from the ceiling or wall (up to 4m), the larger the projection of snowflakes. Our fantastic projector light takes you and your family into a world of moving snowflakes and magic particles. CHRISTMAS DECORATION: The size of our Christmas tree topper is 20cm x 20cm x 4cm, suitable for Christmas trees of many sizes, equipped with sockets without batteries. All you need to do is plug in the socket, and under the illumination of the star topper, the Christmas atmosphere will be full to meet your decoration needs. Glowing stars are like twinkling stars in the sky, adding a warm and cozy atmosphere to your space. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The tree star topper uses environmentally friendly high-quality PVC material, which is strong and durable, has a long service life, is not easy to be damaged or deformed, and can be reused. Super bright LED, low power consumption and energy saving. The lamp does not generate a lot of heat. Our topper decoration has many glitter sequins and powders on the surface，which will come off in some cases, it will stick to a person's hands or skin, but it will come off after washing. EASY TO DECORATE: Tree topper decoration is suitable for indoor and outdoor decoration, can be used in living room, office, shopping mall, park, church, etc. The sparkling LED tree topper adds a festive touch to make partying fun with family and friends. Snow tree topper will transport you into a magical world and give your family and friends an unforgettable evening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816Vv3TFnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qoosea","source_asin":"B0B5K62CCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-394838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5K62CCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5K62CCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
